  "problem": "Given \n$M=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 9 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 7 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}]$,\nwhich of the following elementary row operations makes ${a}_{32}=0?$",
